WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Masaru Captured

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
The Holy Capital's Trap

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:07.510
Masaru Captured!

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:09.550
The Holy Capitals Trap!

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:16.290
Searching for leads on his father, Masaru and the others went to Wanderer's Cape once again.

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:18.370
There, they met BanchouLeomon.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:26.720
Learning the true meaning of the Digisoul, the humans awakened the power that was sleeping within their Digivices,

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:30.820
which allowed Agumon and the others to evolve to their Ultimate Levels.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.930
Ah... Aniki...

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:46.850
Huh?

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:49.760
Do you see the Holy Capital anywhere yet?

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:52.660
Are you sure it's around here?

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:54.750
The compass is pointing in this direction.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:59.220
Of course, that's only if the information that BanchouLeomon gave us was the truth.

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:01.890
A banchou never lies!

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:05.100
Then what? Are you saying that I'm wrong?

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:07.460
You picking a fight or something?

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:09.910
You're the one who's biting my head off!

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:11.070
Oh geez!

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:12.260
Stop it, you two!

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:13.450
Not here!

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:17.340
What's that?

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:18.200
An earthquake?

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:19.710
No!

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:20.700
Something's coming!

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:22.950
There's a Digimon signal?

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:23.620
Master!

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:28.910
It's so big!

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:30.680
Whoa!

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:32.770
No way... I don't believe this!

00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:34.570
Is that also a Digimon?

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:36.080
It appears so, Master.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:56.820
ElDoradimon

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:56.820
Ultimate Level

00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:51.250
ElDoradimon.

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:54.740
An Ultimate Level Digimon with an entire city riding on his shell.

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:56.820
Any information beyond that is shrouded in mystery.

00:01:57.440 --> 00:01:58.540
Everyone!

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:00.530
Welcome to the Holy Capital!

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:05.240
I am Baromon, the mayor of this Holy Capital.

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:07.110
The Holy Capital...

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:08.030
This?

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:08.780
Yes.

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:09.710
Please take a look.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:14.960
ElDoradimon himself is the very town we live in, the Holy Capital.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:16.710
Wow, that's so cool!

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:20.370
We have a warm reception waiting for you in the palace.

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:21.710
Now, come this way.

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:22.600
Come along.

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:23.100
Hey, thanks!

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:23.930
Wait, Masaru!

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.590
Don't just walk off when you please!

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:28.390
What's wrong, Master?

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:30.490
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:33.570
What are you doing?

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:35.110
Hurry it up, Tohma!

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:40.170
You know, you're a real character.

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:41.890
It's gotta be a big feast!

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:44.400
I wonder if they have Sayuri's fried eggs!

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:45.490
No way, it won't be Mom's cooking!

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:49.610
Damn it!

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:50.640
Damn it!!

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:52.850
Give me power, Kurata!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.420
Enough power so that I can...

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.560
crush Daimon Masaru to pieces!!

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:00.230
I have a theory that could work.

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:09.950
You are mutant beings that I've created by drawing out the data from Digimon I'd captured and fusing that data with your human DNA.

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:17.000
If I rewrite the Digimon data that is currently in your DNA into much stronger Digimon data...

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:21.960
you will be able to achieve a further step in evolution.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:26.930
The only problem is... if your bodies can handle it.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:28.880
It will!

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:30.760
As long as I can get my revenge!

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:33.410
I'm honestly quite worried about it,

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:35.730
but you will never hear me say that out loud.

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:37.510
You're saying it.

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:38.060
All of it.

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:42.190
Well then, everyone.

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:44.530
Since I have your consent, we will proceed.

00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:09.770
When you re-awaken, you will be reborn as new warriors.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:15.180
The strongest warriors who can battle on equal ground with the Ultimate Level.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.850
Damn it!

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:21.670
Let me go, you bastards!

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.320
This is a reception? Who do they think they're kidding?

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:24.830
Hey!

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:26.690
What's the meaning of this?

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:29.320
We've seen right through all of your tricks.

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:35.530
You may have thought that after reducing our villages to ash, you could attack the Capital next...

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:36.820
but I won't let you do so!

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:41.340
We came to the Digital World to help you guys!

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:42.750
You can't treat us like this!

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:44.660
Help us?

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:48.070
It's you humans who are making us suffer in the first place!

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:49.220
You're wrong!

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:52.770
The only one at fault here is a man named Kurata!

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:53.930
That's right!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:57.550
If you defeat him, the Digimon hunt will end!

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:58.980
As humans and Digimon...

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:00.850
let's join forces and fight together!

00:06:00.850 --> 00:06:02.480
Silence, all of you!

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:05.760
We have absolutely no intentions of joining you humans!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:06.440
Take them away!

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:07.390
Yes, sir!

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:07.390
Yes, sir!

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:09.300
Let go! Let go of me!

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:11.340
Hey, treat me more gently!

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:13.000
Let go! Let go of me!

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:12.320
Hey!

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:12.670
Aniki!

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:13.370
Master!

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:14.750
Yoshino!

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:17.080
Damn it, you guys better remember this!

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:16.690
Geez!

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:21.710
What shall we do with them?

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:26.660
I'd like to say that those who side with the humans are guilty of the same crime...

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:29.220
but I shed silent tears at the thought of executing fellow Digimon.

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:33.140
Why don't you come with us?

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:42.440
What are you doing?!

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:45.780
Damn it!

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:48.060
What the heck... 

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:48.650
Agumon!

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:50.410
Aniki!

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:51.530
Master!

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:52.460
Yoshino!

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:57.330
As of this moment, we will now commence the humans' execution!

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:02.830
Just throwing us into execution is a bit extreme, isn't it?

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:05.210
They should at least let us call for a lawyer.

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:10.380
Let me now introduce you to one of your companions!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:16.850
You're...!

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:19.000
The old man with the Digivice!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.310
What's this, you three were caught, too?

00:07:22.310 --> 00:07:24.400
How pathetic.

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:26.190
Who's the most pathetic one here?!

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:27.750
Open the gate!

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:42.830
Cerberumon

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:42.830
Perfect Level

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:35.450
Cerberumon.

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:38.500
A Perfect Level Digimon who is said to guard the gates of Hell.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.290
His special attack is Hell Fire.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:42.830
It can burn everything to ashes in an instant!

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:45.310
Go, Cerberumon!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.640
Turn the humans into mincemeat!

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:51.300
Aniki!

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:53.470
Release Master!

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:59.420
Humans who discover the existence of the Holy Capital cannot be overlooked!

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:00.180
No way!

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:02.380
Damn it!

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:05.030
Where do you think you're going?

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:06.110
It's obvious!

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:07.690
We're going to save Master and the others!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.610
Forget about the humans.

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:15.640
The humans squish us like mere insects.

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:19.280
Humans and Digimon are two existences that were and always will be incompatible with each other!

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:21.090
That's not tr-!

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:23.420
You've got it all wrong!

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:26.000
Humans and Digimon can become friends!

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:28.190
Impossible.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:34.670
The hearts of those who've been hurt by what the humans have done will never be persuaded otherwise.

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:36.180
Baromon...

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:41.310
Becoming our allies and fighting the humans is your best choice.

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:43.100
If not...

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:45.600
You will also be executed.

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:54.530
Kamemon?

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:57.770
Hey!

00:08:57.770 --> 00:08:59.450
Why are you heading towards me first?!

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:02.830
Yoshino-san!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.040
Yoshino!

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:05.750
Nuts Shoot!

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:10.350
Lalamon!

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:11.130
Agumon!

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:14.950
Aniki!

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:16.060
Yoshino!

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:17.430
Double Backhand!

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:19.340
All right!

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:26.440
Why did you...?

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:29.350
I couldn't abandon you.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:31.690
Since when did they...?!

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:32.570
Baromon-sama!

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:33.530
Their ropes were cut...

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:35.400
It doesn't matter!

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:39.060
Do away with them all!

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:45.900
What?

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:47.160
Yoshino!

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:52.420
Don't think you can get away with what you tried to do earlier!

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:56.050
Come and get it!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:03.450
Masaru!

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:04.100
Now!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.000
All right!

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:09.310
Here it is!

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:14.730
That Digisoul...!

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:24.070
That voice...

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:25.830
ElDoradimon is wailing!

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:28.160
Digisoul Charge!

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:30.330
WAIT!!!

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:35.070
That's enough!

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:37.210
Their execution is suspended!

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.440
Why, Baromon-sama?!

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:41.770
These guys are our enemy!

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:44.680
Do you still not remember?

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:50.440
A long time ago, a lone man came to visit this Holy Capital.

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:54.110
That time,

00:10:54.110 --> 00:10:57.550
the huge bulk of the Holy Capital that ElDoradimon was supporting

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:02.250
prevented him from crossing the hot, sandy deserts.

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:05.530
There was no choice but to wait for him to die.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:08.950
Just when everyone believed there was no way out...

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:13.120
That man appeared.

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:29.140
All right!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.560
That man's name was...

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:35.210
Daimon Suguru!

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:37.230
Dad did that?!

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:40.740
That Digisoul of yours that burns like fire!

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:45.500
Y-You're Daimon Suguru's son, are you not?!

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:48.950
That's Daimon Suguru's son?!

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:50.830
He's...

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:52.590
Daimon Suguru's...

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:54.570
You guys!

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:58.170
Do you dare to harm the son of our hero, the one who saved our Capital?!

00:11:59.590 --> 00:12:01.630
Make preparations for the banquet at once!

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:06.180
We're saved...

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:08.500
Masaru!

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:11.070
Your father's amazing!

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:11.770
I guess so.

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:14.980
Are you all right, Master?

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:16.590
Yeah.

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:17.540
Master?

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:27.660
I never would have dreamed that you were the son of Daimon Suguru.

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:29.570
Please accept my humblest apologies.

00:12:29.570 --> 00:12:31.370
As long as you get it.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:32.790
It's good to see you safe and sound, Chief.

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:35.260
DATS no longer exists, doesn't it?

00:12:35.260 --> 00:12:36.370
You can call me Yushima.

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:38.440
You knew?

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.720
I've heard rumors floating around.

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:44.550
It appears I've caused you quite the painful experience.

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:46.230
You've got that right!

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:48.010
Where were you all this time?

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:51.220
After I sent you guys back to the human world...

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:04.900
Kamemon and I were barely holding onto our lives as we escaped from Infinity Ice Ridge.

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:08.380
While we were wandering throughout the Digital World,

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:13.040
we learned that Professor Daimon had gone on a journey to find Yggdrasil.

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:19.580
I figured that we'd need that man's help to prevent an all-out war between the humans and Digimon,

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:23.340
so we went on a journey to follow his tracks.

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:28.010
And along the way, we came upon this Holy Capital,

00:13:28.010 --> 00:13:29.010
which is why we're here.

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:31.870
...He talked!

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:34.960
Kamemon is shy.

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:37.870
He rarely speaks in front of other people.

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:42.070
Daimon Suguru is like the Messiah to us.

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:46.240
Now, eat plenty tonight and cultivate your strength.

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:47.680
The Messiah...

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:51.010
Aniki, what's a "Messiah?"

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:52.750
Um, it's a...

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:55.070
It means he's stronger than a banchou.

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:56.710
Yeah, that's it!

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.740
He's stronger than a banchou?!

00:13:58.740 --> 00:14:01.240
Your dad's amazing!

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:02.030
I guess so!

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:07.350
Let's all combine forces and protect our Holy Capital to the end!

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:04.780
Master?

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:08.590
Yeah!

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:08.590
Yeah!

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:17.880
A Messiah, huh...?

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:18.520
Master.

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:20.980
Are you feeling ill?

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:22.440
No.

00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:25.600
I was just envious...

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:28.950
that he has a father who can be respected so unconditionally.

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:30.810
That's rare...

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:32.950
To hear you being jealous of someone.

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:34.910
Jealous? Me?

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:36.870
Master...

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:39.350
I see...

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:41.300
I'm being jealous...

00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:50.260
The enemy is attacking!

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:51.680
What?

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:52.910
Everyone!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:55.150
Fortify the defenses!

00:14:55.150 --> 00:14:55.890
Yes, sir!

00:14:55.150 --> 00:14:55.890
Yes, sir!

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:57.980
Let's join them, Agumon!

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:58.850
Yeah!

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:09.170
Don't falter!

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:09.740
Keep going!

00:15:10.230 --> 00:15:13.450
Don't let even one of them enter the Holy Capital!

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:22.440
Those guys...

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:25.040
They're sucking up the Digimon's energy...

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:26.960
Everyone, get back!

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:30.110
We'll take it from here!

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:30.760
Yeah.

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:30.760
Yeah.

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:36.080
Digisoul Charge!

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:36.080
Digisoul Charge!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.730
Overdrive!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.730
Overdrive!

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:39.550
Lalamon, evolve!

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:58.030
Rosemon!

00:15:58.380 --> 00:15:59.600
Gaomon, evolve!

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:19.670
MirageGaogamon!

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:22.280
Double Crescent Mirage!

00:16:25.590 --> 00:16:26.360
They're fast!

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:28.500
Thorn Whip!

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:33.490
Now, Masaru!

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:42.160
He certainly has the same Digisoul as Suguru!

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:47.770
Digisoul Charge!

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:48.770
Overdrive!

00:16:49.630 --> 00:16:51.290
Agumon, evolve!

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:13.150
ShineGreymon!

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:19.020
Gale Claw!

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:24.860
Roses Rapier!

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:28.810
Glorious Burst!

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:34.940
All right!

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:36.570
They did it!

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:38.550
Just what you'd expect from our savior's son!

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.360
Not bad!

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:47.910
What's that?

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:49.880
No way! They must've been creating a diversion!

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:51.310
Come back, ShineGreymon!

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:52.610
Damn it!

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:54.550
Another one of them was lurking around!

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:56.670
Everyone!

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:57.360
Run!

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:00.870
We can't make it in time!

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:02.340
Damn it!

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:04.910
Masaru! You can't face it on your own!

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:07.120
Uchitake Otoshi!

00:18:11.930 --> 00:18:12.460
That's...!

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:14.880
Ikuto! Falcomon!

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:15.880
Masaru!

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:20.390
I not only one who came!

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:21.840
Brought many friends!

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:23.560
Friends?

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:32.810
Igamon

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:32.810
Adult Level

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:27.590
Igamon.

00:18:27.590 --> 00:18:30.550
An Adult Level Digimon who specializes in moving stealthily!

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:32.810
He leads the enemy astray with his talented ninja techniques!

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:37.450
Iga-Ryuu Iai Jutsu!

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:37.450
Iga-Style Sword Drawing Technique

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:49.000
All right!

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:49.000
All right!

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:58.530
BanchouLeomon said we need power.

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:03.300
Mercurimon always said we need friends to help protect the Digital World.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:04.830
So I thought,

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:07.990
maybe having power means having friends.

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:11.020
That's why me and Falcomon brought friends.

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:13.360
We are the Igamon clan.

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:15.850
We shall assist Ikuto-dono in his fight.

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:18.850
NOTE: <i>-Dono</i> (殿) is a suffix that was more commonly used in olden times. It is added after a person's name to show one's respect for that person.

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:18.330
Ikuto, you're amazing!

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:20.090
Let's all fight together...

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:21.700
to protect the Digital World!

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:46.870
Just as I thought, this substance is the energy that makes up the life of a Digimon.

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.230
Damn that Kurata...

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:50.770
What is he planning to use this for?

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:59.550
Everything is running smoothly.

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:04.160
Now, indulge in more and more of the Digimon's lives and grow bigger!

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:08.010
All for the sake of granting my dreams...!

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:11.950
The experimental specimens have awoken.

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:13.040
I'll be there.

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:27.280
Good morning!

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:28.550
How are you feeling?

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:29.480
Great!

00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:30.680
This is the best I've ever felt!

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:32.920
I can feel power swelling up within me!

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:34.060
It's not bad.

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:36.190
That's good to hear.

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:40.550
Professor Kurata.

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:45.250
Response from the 15th Squad at Point 303 has disappeared.

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:47.110
Send me an image of the data analysis.

00:20:47.110 --> 00:20:47.950
It's on the screen.

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:49.830
Is that a city?

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:52.120
No, this is ElDoradimon.

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:55.040
It's the only fortress that the Digimon have left.

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:57.290
Daimon Masaru is there, right?

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:58.580
Of course.

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:03.050
They're the only ones who can defeat the Gizmon:XT.

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:09.650
Please order all of the Gizmon that were dispatched throughout the Digital World to gather at Point 303.

00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:10.300
Understood.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:17.580
According to my predictions, thousands of Digimon should already be assembled at that place.

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:22.480
If I kill ElDoradimon, my ambitions will be nearly achieved.

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:24.340
Everyone.

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:26.000
Are you ready?

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:27.950
Yeah. I'm okay to go anytime.

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:30.560
Then let's get going.

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:34.610
This is likely to be our last battle.

